WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.126
Tens are the stems; units are the leaves.

2
00:00:03.852 --> 00:00:08.302
Each row is a stem: the tens digit. The leaves are the units.

3
00:00:09.055 --> 00:00:14.380
Three, then one, five, five, eight: thirty one, thirty five, thirty five, thirty eight.

4
00:00:15.185 --> 00:00:19.210
Every value is kept, and the shape shows where most of them are.
